zallama — Zallama CLI
Usage: zallama <command> [args]

Commands:
  serve           Start the Zallama daemon
  list            List registered models
  add <name> <file>  Register a local .gguf model (--mmproj for vision)
  remove <name>   Remove a model from registry
  run <name>      Interactive chat with a model
  bench <name>    Benchmark tokens/sec across parameter sweeps
  ps              Show running model processes
